    "do": "Cross, with Magnolia Pruitt's route or without it. The herd will not go on your say-so alone and that is the actual problem to solve.",
    "lose": "Water, days, and cattle that lie down and do not get up. Nothing on the flats is a fight; everything on them is attrition.",
